{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 15, "ref": "2-kings 10:15", "book": "2-kings", "lang": "sv", "chapter": 10, "translation": "Och han gick därifrån och fann ⟨את⟩ Jehonadav, son till Rekav, när han kom emot honom, och han välsignade honom och sade till honom: Finns det i ditt hjärta det rätta, så som mitt hjärta ⟨är⟩ med ditt hjärta? Och ⟨את⟩ Jehonadav sade: Det finns, det finns. Räck ⟨את⟩ din hand! Och han räckte sin hand, och han förde upp honom till sig upp i vagnen.", "tokens": [{"surface": "וילך", "gloss": "Och han gick"}, {"surface": "משם", "gloss": "därifrån"}, {"surface": "וימצא", "gloss": "och fann"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "Jehonadav"}, {"surface": "יהונדב", "gloss": "Jehonadav"}, {"surface": "בן", "gloss": "son"}, {"surface": "רכב", "gloss": "till Rekav"}, {"surface": "לקראתו", "gloss": "när han kom emot honom"}, {"surface": "ויברכהו", "gloss": "och han välsignade honom"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "אליו", "gloss": "till honom"}, {"surface": "היש", "gloss": "Finns det"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "ditt hjärta"}, {"surface": "לבבך", "gloss": "i ditt hjärta"}, {"surface": "ישר", "gloss": "det rätta"}, {"surface": "כאשר", "gloss": "så som"}, {"surface": "לבבי", "gloss": "mitt hjärta"}, {"surface": "עם", "gloss": "med"}, {"surface": "לבבך", "gloss": "ditt hjärta"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "och sade"}, {"surface": "יהונדב", "gloss": "Jehonadav"}, {"surface": "יש", "gloss": "Det finns"}, {"surface": "ויש", "gloss": "det finns"}, {"surface": "תנה", "gloss": "Räck"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "din hand"}, {"surface": "ידך", "gloss": "din hand"}, {"surface": "ויתן", "gloss": "och han räckte"}, {"surface": "ידו", "gloss": "sin hand"}, {"surface": "ויעלהו", "gloss": "och han förde upp honom"}, {"surface": "אליו", "gloss": "till sig"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "upp i"}, {"surface": "המרכבה", "gloss": "vagnen"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-17T18:35:35.849721221Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}